        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiowa%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Kiowa sits on the east side of Kiowa Creek, a north‑flowing tributary of the South Platte River, giving the town a distinctive geographic setting.",
